{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00925","headline":"横吹曲辞 出关 · 魏徵","name":"横吹曲辞 出关","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"中原还逐鹿，投笔事戎轩。\n纵横计不就，慷慨志犹存。\n策杖谒天子，驱马出关门。\n请缨羁南越，凭轼下东藩。\n郁纡陟高岫，出没望平原。\n古木吟寒鸟，空山啼夜猨。\n既伤千里目，还惊九折魂。\n岂不惮艰险，深怀国士恩。\n季布无二诺，侯嬴重一言。\n人生感意气，功名谁复论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏徵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00925.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00925","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}